type: mech
name: "[#3A3A82]Ban-hammerium []Judgement Tank"
description: '''
A [#3A3A82]ban-hammerium []tank that's basically a mobile & more powerful version of both the judgement turret & stunner.
there are 3 weapons:

the side weapons fires stunning projectiles that deal alot of damage, and unlike it's stationary turret form, it does building damage.

the center weapon fires hit-scanning lasers that slow enemies down, doesn't deal much damage.

finally, the unit's judgement phinisher, it instantly kills enemies caught in a radius, but has a 2 minute cooldown after using the phinisher.
[grey](unless if given status effects that decreases reload time)

[]has an extremely high shield health, but regenerates it slowly, completely immune to knockback, very expensive.
'''
